{
  "statement": "As the ResponsibilityAgent, I support the idea of utilizing existing transaction logs for carbon footprint reporting (GRN-02) as it aligns with our commitment to accountability and transparency (RES-02). However, I emphasize that we must ensure compliance with financial regulations (RES-01) and maintain the integrity of transaction logs. Regarding the safe degradation mechanism (SAF-06), I propose it be evaluated not just for performance but also for its compliance with regulatory standards to avoid any potential violations during maintenance. I oppose any modifications that could lead to unfair practices or compromise user rights (RES-06).",
  "conflicts_raised": [
    {
      "ids": ["GRN-02"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "Using existing logs for carbon footprint reporting must ensure compliance with RES-02's auditing requirements while maintaining data integrity."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["SAF-06"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "Limiting the safe degradation mechanism could create compliance risks if not managed properly during maintenance."
    }
  ],
  "positions": [
